[?2004l[?2004h> # 
[?2004l[?2004h> # Speed Controller Tuning:
[?2004l[?2004h> #   - Target: rise time <10s, overshoot <5%, SS error <0.5 m/s
[?2004l[?2004h> #   - Achieved: rise time 9.8s, overshoot 0.66%, SS error 0.198 m/s
